/*
 * Stateful differential harness (evaluation side).
 *
 * Links against the ORIGINAL game objects. For each case, two forked children
 * build the same random world (seeded), one calls the original function, the
 * other the reconstruction; each dumps the full game state + engine-call log
 * to the parent, which compares them byte for byte.
 *
 * Build-time: -DSIG_H="<header>" generated by difftest.py from the target's
 * signature code; orig_target / recon_target are bound at link time.
 * Run: harness dev|heldout [ncases]
 * Output (stdout, last line): JSON with cases, mismatches, skipped.
 */
